# 🚀 Asmaa-EduCore: All-in-One K-Platform for International Students

### ### A Mobile-Built AI & EdTech Ecosystem for Global Student Success

[![Streamlit App](https://streamlit.io)](https://streamlit.app)

## 📝 Project Overview
**Asmaa-EduCore** is a multi-functional dynamic web ecosystem designed, developed, and deployed **entirely from a smartphone**. Due to strict hardware and computing infrastructure limitations in my local community in Upper Egypt, this project leverages cloud-based development environments and mobile IDEs to deliver scalable, practical educational tools tailored for international and exchange students in South Korea.

---

## 🛠️ Ecosystem Modules (Unified via Sidebar)

The entire platform is seamlessly integrated into a single, clean interface where users can seamlessly switch between three independent applications using an interactive sidebar:

### 1. 🇰🇷 Korean Language Platform
An interactive, self-paced educational module engineered to help Arabic-speaking students master the Korean language and prepare effectively for GKS and TOPIK exams.
* **Features:** Dynamic Hangul alphabet trainers, interactive K-Pop lyric analysis modules, categorized vocabulary testing suites, and structural data parsing.
* **Tech Core:** Optimized Python native data structures, clean loops, and stateful text components.

### 2. 🍳 Halal & Haram Food Checker
A logic-based validation engine focused on solving dietary compliance issues for Muslim exchange students traveling to South Korea and East Asia.
* **Features:** Image upload and camera capabilities simulating Optical Character Recognition (OCR). The system parses text outputs and performs robust string-matching algorithms against a predefined blacklist of non-halal ingredients.
* **Tech Core:** Streamlit camera input integration, Python string matching, and custom CSS color-coded UI alerts.

### 3. ⏱️ Smart Break Timer
A cognitive health and productivity tool rooted in the Pomodoro technique, specifically optimized to enhance focus during high-intensity academic examination seasons.
* **Features:** Customizable study-to-rest interval cycles, localized cognitive text updates, and an accelerated simulation engine designed for live technical demonstrations.
* **Tech Core:** Streamlit session state management and background asynchronous timing components.

